{"suttaId":"thag6.1","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[1717,1735],"vripara":"375"},"segments":{"thag6.1:0.4":"Uruveḷakassapattheragāthā","thag6.1:1.1":"“Disvāna pāṭihīrāni, gotamassa yasassino;","thag6.1:1.3":"Na tāvāhaṃ paṇipatiṃ, issāmānena vañcito.","thag6.1:2.1":"“Mama saṅkappamaññāya, codesi narasārathi;","thag6.1:2.3":"Tato me āsi saṃvego, abbhuto lomahaṃsano.","thag6.1:3.1":"“Pubbe jaṭilabhūtassa, yā me siddhi parittikā;","thag6.1:3.3":"Tāhaṃ tadā nirākatvā [niraṃkatvā (syā. ka.)], pabbajiṃ jinasāsane.","thag6.1:4.1":"“Pubbe yaññena santuṭṭho, kāmadhātupurakkhato;","thag6.1:4.3":"Pacchā rāgañca dosañca, mohañcāpi samūhaniṃ.","thag6.1:5.1":"“Pubbenivāsaṃ jānāmi, dibbacakkhu visodhitaṃ;","thag6.1:5.3":"Iddhimā paracittaññū, dibbasotañca pāpuṇiṃ.","thag6.1:6.1":"“Yassa catthāya pabbajito, agārasmānagāriyaṃ;","thag6.1:6.3":"So me attho anuppatto, sabbasaṃyojanakkhayo”ti.","thag6.1:6.5":"… Uruveḷakassapo thero …."},"attha":{"book":"Th-a-ii","bookName":"Theragāthā-1-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0508a2.att","from":1107,"to":1107,"paras":[{"para":1107,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag6.1:6"],"lines":["<b>So me attho anuppatto, sabbasaṃyojanakkhayo</b>ti yo sabbesaṃ saṃyojanānaṃ khayabhūto khayena vā laddhabbo, so sadattho paramattho ca mayā ariyamaggādhigamena adhigatoti.","Evametāya gāthāya therassa aññābyākaraṇaṃ ahosīti veditabbo."],"lineRefs":[["thag6.1:6"],["thag6.1:6"]]}],"wordLinks":[["thag6.1:6.3","so me attho anuppatto sabbasaṃyojanakkhayo",0,0]]},"tika":null}
